  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19: Vaccine Support Project under the Asia Pacific Vaccine Access Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project responds to the government&amp;apos;s request for ADB support under APVAX to help meet COVID-19 vaccine response challenges. In accordance with the guidance of the APVAX policy, the project investment component under APVAX will support ADB?s procurement and project implementation, which will benefit Tajikistan given due diligence assessments that identified fiduciary-related risks.</narrative>
  </description>
